{"id":"e419ede20b7ef468","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-wiles.md","title":"Wiles' Theorem","display":"thm-wiles — Wiles' Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-wiles","aliases":["58-thm-wiles"],"display":"thm-wiles — Wiles' Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]]","[[58-df-elliptic-modularity-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-wiles"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-wiles</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-wiles — Wiles' Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74f4744df7db749f\" href=\"?note=74f4744df7db749f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md\">../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"39648aefc44f4243\" href=\"?note=39648aefc44f4243\" title=\"58-df-elliptic-modularity-data.md\">58-df-elliptic-modularity-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,O,K_E\\in V\">\\(E,O,K_E\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_E=\\langle+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0,1,A,B\\rangle\">\\(K_E=\\langle+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0,1,A,B\\rangle\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathbb Q\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\)</span>；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_E\">\\(K_E\\)</span> 是依赖文件的短 Weierstrass 方程呈示。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\\)</span> 使用既有四元定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModularEllipticCurve}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModularEllipticCurve}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-elliptic-modularity-data</code> 的实际整模型、有限点数及尖点形式构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}wiles} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\\land\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,\\mathbb Q,K_E)\\to\\mathrm{ModularEllipticCurve}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,\\mathbb Q,K_E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}wiles} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\\land\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,\\mathbb Q,K_E)\\to\\mathrm{ModularEllipticCurve}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,\\mathbb Q,K_E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条保留半稳定椭圆曲线的模性结论，不将它替换成更强的全体椭圆曲线模性结论。方程呈示并非函数域，算术运算固定为通常有理数运算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md","status":"resolved","id":"74f4744df7db749f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elliptic-modularity-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"39648aefc44f4243","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elliptic-modularity-data.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,O,K_E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"K_E=\\langle+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0,1,A,B\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"K_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModularEllipticCurve}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}wiles} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\\land\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,\\mathbb Q,K_E)\\to\\mathrm{ModularEllipticCurve}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,\\mathbb Q,K_E)","display":true}],"bytes":1167,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4490","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-thm-wiles.md|58-thm-wiles]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["74f4744df7db749f","39648aefc44f4243"]}